            %p
              is the (uniquely defined) action of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinity-anafunctor"} infinity-anafunctor
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
